OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReport calls for tougher action on
OL,4,Adrugs in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, drug use remained a serious
OL,7,Fconcern, it said, while cuts to
OL,8,Feducation provision had led to
OL,9,Fprisoners spending longer in cells with
OL,10,Ffewer prospects for rehabilitation.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said the
OL,13,Fgovernment had "inherited a prison
OL,14,Fsystem in crisis" but was pleased by
OL,15,Fthe "significant progress" at HMP
OL,16,FRochester.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
